{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/25b84e14560b35222d14b426e0748886.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1024 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare your mower and blower, and get ready to head to the heartland of mowing...\u00a0Lawn Mowing Simulator 2 is heading to the USA to start a whole new career in the world of lawncare!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lawn Mowing Simulator 2 (LMS2)</strong>\u00a0is the sequel to Lawn Mowing Simulator, which builds on the rewarding working-sim feel of the original. Listening to community feedback, and internal reflections, <strong>LMS2</strong> will offer an expanded take on professional lawn care and use real-world equipment from manufacturer partners\u00a0<i><strong>Kubota</strong></i><strong>, <i>SCAG\u24c7</i> and <i>STIGA</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ec6eb649ebbc3435dae1ae8437deb0db.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ec6eb649ebbc3435dae1ae8437deb0db.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ec6eb649ebbc3435dae1ae8437deb0db.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a <strong>brand new USA setting</strong> with all new contracts, which will be built with a new grass tech to allow players to get the best cut ever, as you'll see from these comparison shots between LMS and LMS2!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e04fab715b099a5f3c141233660a9a47.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e04fab715b099a5f3c141233660a9a47.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e04fab715b099a5f3c141233660a9a47.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/829a3963f0b2d96cd6b1bc5a89b74856.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/829a3963f0b2d96cd6b1bc5a89b74856.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/829a3963f0b2d96cd6b1bc5a89b74856.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only that, but new mowers and string trimmers will be included, as well as the much requested <strong>leaf blowers</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f05886306ad58bfd376b08896cac8a65.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f05886306ad58bfd376b08896cac8a65.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f05886306ad58bfd376b08896cac8a65.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career mode gets a total overhaul for all you management fans with an explorable HQ from which to run your business, as well as enhanced character customisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/0872f0b1b9c84ad3713f98185c808c86.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/0872f0b1b9c84ad3713f98185c808c86.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/0872f0b1b9c84ad3713f98185c808c86.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are excited to confirm that <strong>Lawn Mowing Simulator 2</strong> will be releasing on <strong>Steam in 2026</strong>, followed by P<strong>layStation 5 and Xbox Series X | S later</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/fe819e0f85b00f68454d6641374a368a.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LMS2</strong> will feature a new <strong>USA setting</strong>, with brand new location designs for players to play in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/fc42f3b65e6a6e2711930cdcd0e837e5.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From suburban lawns to commercial and municipal locations, the game will feature contracts set in all manner of locations of varying sizes and themes - while the addition of new equipment means that there will be more to do in every location than just cutting the grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/483c6cc93652e5654b1a3c1c0eb3b2cf.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/05cd02c3ff19c7a8b6377f04533b8045.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love that some of you out there have racked up amazing numbers of hours  playing the first LMS (some more than 1,000!) - and we hope you will in LMS2 as well. So to help with those hours of mowing gameplay continuing to feel fresh, we are developing a system where gardens can change with each visit with new features that change how you approach completing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9631e2fe8ea5b8eade6c2a5a5999fb00.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9631e2fe8ea5b8eade6c2a5a5999fb00.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9631e2fe8ea5b8eade6c2a5a5999fb00.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One visit to a house might see it have a new series of flower beds added, then the next time an above ground pool or flagpole has appeared. This ensures that not every visit to the location is the same for when you are 60 hours deep into your career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/38f45d236ca2a7d3473c570043f114ef.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know these have been wanted for a long time, and in <strong>LMS2</strong> we plan to have <strong>Leaf Blowers</strong> as a part of the core game for clearing up leaves, as well as grass clippings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9fec6a22798c219d851f15a2c8eefee6.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9fec6a22798c219d851f15a2c8eefee6.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9fec6a22798c219d851f15a2c8eefee6.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Leaf Blowers wouldn\u2019t be much fun without a lot of leaves to blast! So in <strong>LMS2</strong> we plan on having a system where tens of thousands of leaves can be blown around at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/2aaa4e3a283118dfc55d40641a28c057.avif?t=1773946552\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/2aaa4e3a283118dfc55d40641a28c057.avif?t=1773946552 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/8a47afe336c76dfb43cf617e20996cbd.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t only have a leaf blower to get the job done! <strong>LMS2</strong> will also give the player a trusty <strong>rake</strong> to help get leaves out of those hard to get places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a44469cf748aae221a89cf63027933fa.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a44469cf748aae221a89cf63027933fa.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a44469cf748aae221a89cf63027933fa.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/4aa0d30a342c4469b66ea381690e4b92.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new line up of mowers and string trimmers will be available in <strong>LMS2</strong>, as well as the new addition of leaf blowers, with each one being meticulously recreated in game to be as accurate as possible.\u00a0We\u2019ve created this handy comparison to show how LMS2 at launch will compare with the original game when it released: <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/46cff8dc42fb598b9371556d3f92f260.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you can see, <strong>LMS2 </strong>will feature <strong>more equipment</strong> than its predecessor, and we have great plans for even more additions to the line-up post-release - just like the original game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what are the mowers, string trimmers and leaf blowers? Well, here are the details! Well, we\u2019re delighted that <strong>Kubota</strong>, <strong>SCAG\u00ae</strong> and <strong>STIGA</strong> have all signed up to be a part of <strong>LMS2</strong>, while we will also be bringing back our own in-house brand Patterson as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/b1b1b87515bc5bde94198f7d2ecd7096.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eagle-eyed among you will notice there\u2019s still one mower yet to be revealed - make sure you\u2019re in our <strong>Discord</strong> and follow our socials to get that information first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/dd3c5f85eb5cb8c28e1f67bc06d7ea27.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/dd3c5f85eb5cb8c28e1f67bc06d7ea27.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/dd3c5f85eb5cb8c28e1f67bc06d7ea27.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/251f6344baed855da2d04bbc1c7aa5a4.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/251f6344baed855da2d04bbc1c7aa5a4.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/251f6344baed855da2d04bbc1c7aa5a4.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/179a6b389ea54b954b93d54c557d518c.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/6e470d758a9d2950c83150615089c17d.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/3e882ba1cf65c2a9ac9034533d17a76a.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are investing a lot of development time to build a <strong>new grass system</strong> from scratch, that will allow for the Lawns in <strong>LMS2</strong> to be more beautifully rendered and offer much more variety in looks and how the player interacts with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/792e805bcee812d44db2b0aa3d9d5c77.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/daa6930896416324361078cfdad464bc.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flowers</strong> and <strong>weeds</strong> will now become a part of the lawn's make up, as well as much more variation in the uncut lawn, which will really highlight your efforts as a player to make an overgrown lawn look perfect.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831210?t=1773946552","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831210?t=1773946552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/4475334d6810dbd21145a9c58e5f71ea1f36da3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773946552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/4475334d6810dbd21145a9c58e5f71ea1f36da3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773946552","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/25b84e14560b35222d14b426e0748886.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1024 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare your mower and blower, and get ready to head to the heartland of mowing...\u00a0Lawn Mowing Simulator 2 is heading to the USA to start a whole new career in the world of lawncare!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lawn Mowing Simulator 2 (LMS2)</strong>\u00a0is the sequel to Lawn Mowing Simulator, which builds on the rewarding working-sim feel of the original. Listening to community feedback, and internal reflections, <strong>LMS2</strong> will offer an expanded take on professional lawn care and use real-world equipment from manufacturer partners\u00a0<i><strong>Kubota</strong></i><strong>, <i>SCAG\u24c7</i> and <i>STIGA</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ec6eb649ebbc3435dae1ae8437deb0db.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ec6eb649ebbc3435dae1ae8437deb0db.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ec6eb649ebbc3435dae1ae8437deb0db.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a <strong>brand new USA setting</strong> with all new contracts, which will be built with a new grass tech to allow players to get the best cut ever, as you'll see from these comparison shots between LMS and LMS2!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e04fab715b099a5f3c141233660a9a47.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e04fab715b099a5f3c141233660a9a47.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e04fab715b099a5f3c141233660a9a47.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/829a3963f0b2d96cd6b1bc5a89b74856.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/829a3963f0b2d96cd6b1bc5a89b74856.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/829a3963f0b2d96cd6b1bc5a89b74856.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only that, but new mowers and string trimmers will be included, as well as the much requested <strong>leaf blowers</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f05886306ad58bfd376b08896cac8a65.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f05886306ad58bfd376b08896cac8a65.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f05886306ad58bfd376b08896cac8a65.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career mode gets a total overhaul for all you management fans with an explorable HQ from which to run your business, as well as enhanced character customisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/0872f0b1b9c84ad3713f98185c808c86.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/0872f0b1b9c84ad3713f98185c808c86.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/0872f0b1b9c84ad3713f98185c808c86.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are excited to confirm that <strong>Lawn Mowing Simulator 2</strong> will be releasing on <strong>Steam in 2026</strong>, followed by P<strong>layStation 5 and Xbox Series X | S later</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/fe819e0f85b00f68454d6641374a368a.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LMS2</strong> will feature a new <strong>USA setting</strong>, with brand new location designs for players to play in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/fc42f3b65e6a6e2711930cdcd0e837e5.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From suburban lawns to commercial and municipal locations, the game will feature contracts set in all manner of locations of varying sizes and themes - while the addition of new equipment means that there will be more to do in every location than just cutting the grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/483c6cc93652e5654b1a3c1c0eb3b2cf.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/05cd02c3ff19c7a8b6377f04533b8045.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love that some of you out there have racked up amazing numbers of hours  playing the first LMS (some more than 1,000!) - and we hope you will in LMS2 as well. So to help with those hours of mowing gameplay continuing to feel fresh, we are developing a system where gardens can change with each visit with new features that change how you approach completing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9631e2fe8ea5b8eade6c2a5a5999fb00.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9631e2fe8ea5b8eade6c2a5a5999fb00.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9631e2fe8ea5b8eade6c2a5a5999fb00.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One visit to a house might see it have a new series of flower beds added, then the next time an above ground pool or flagpole has appeared. This ensures that not every visit to the location is the same for when you are 60 hours deep into your career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/38f45d236ca2a7d3473c570043f114ef.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know these have been wanted for a long time, and in <strong>LMS2</strong> we plan to have <strong>Leaf Blowers</strong> as a part of the core game for clearing up leaves, as well as grass clippings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9fec6a22798c219d851f15a2c8eefee6.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9fec6a22798c219d851f15a2c8eefee6.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9fec6a22798c219d851f15a2c8eefee6.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Leaf Blowers wouldn\u2019t be much fun without a lot of leaves to blast! So in <strong>LMS2</strong> we plan on having a system where tens of thousands of leaves can be blown around at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/2aaa4e3a283118dfc55d40641a28c057.avif?t=1773946552\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/2aaa4e3a283118dfc55d40641a28c057.avif?t=1773946552 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/8a47afe336c76dfb43cf617e20996cbd.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t only have a leaf blower to get the job done! <strong>LMS2</strong> will also give the player a trusty <strong>rake</strong> to help get leaves out of those hard to get places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a44469cf748aae221a89cf63027933fa.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a44469cf748aae221a89cf63027933fa.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a44469cf748aae221a89cf63027933fa.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/4aa0d30a342c4469b66ea381690e4b92.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new line up of mowers and string trimmers will be available in <strong>LMS2</strong>, as well as the new addition of leaf blowers, with each one being meticulously recreated in game to be as accurate as possible.\u00a0We\u2019ve created this handy comparison to show how LMS2 at launch will compare with the original game when it released: <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/46cff8dc42fb598b9371556d3f92f260.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you can see, <strong>LMS2 </strong>will feature <strong>more equipment</strong> than its predecessor, and we have great plans for even more additions to the line-up post-release - just like the original game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what are the mowers, string trimmers and leaf blowers? Well, here are the details! Well, we\u2019re delighted that <strong>Kubota</strong>, <strong>SCAG\u00ae</strong> and <strong>STIGA</strong> have all signed up to be a part of <strong>LMS2</strong>, while we will also be bringing back our own in-house brand Patterson as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/b1b1b87515bc5bde94198f7d2ecd7096.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eagle-eyed among you will notice there\u2019s still one mower yet to be revealed - make sure you\u2019re in our <strong>Discord</strong> and follow our socials to get that information first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/dd3c5f85eb5cb8c28e1f67bc06d7ea27.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/dd3c5f85eb5cb8c28e1f67bc06d7ea27.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/dd3c5f85eb5cb8c28e1f67bc06d7ea27.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/251f6344baed855da2d04bbc1c7aa5a4.poster.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/251f6344baed855da2d04bbc1c7aa5a4.webm?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/251f6344baed855da2d04bbc1c7aa5a4.mp4?t=1773946552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/179a6b389ea54b954b93d54c557d518c.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/6e470d758a9d2950c83150615089c17d.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/3e882ba1cf65c2a9ac9034533d17a76a.avif?t=1773946552\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are investing a lot of development time to build a <strong>new grass system</strong> from scratch, that will allow for the Lawns in <strong>LMS2</strong> to be more beautifully rendered and offer much more variety in looks and how the player interacts with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/792e805bcee812d44db2b0aa3d9d5c77.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/daa6930896416324361078cfdad464bc.avif?t=1773946552\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flowers</strong> and <strong>weeds</strong> will now become a part of the lawn's make up, as well as much more variation in the uncut lawn, which will really highlight your efforts as a player to make an overgrown lawn look perfect.</p>","developers":["Skyhook Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/7894efb2f692857c4191bc979c18468207885ee0/header.jpg?t=1773946552","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Lawn Mowing Simulator \u00a9 Skyhook Games Ltd. The intellectual property rights, including trademarks and copyright for the lawn mowers and brands featured in the game, belong to their respective owners.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Lawn Mowing Simulator 2","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400, AMD Ryzen 5 1400, or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050Ti, AMD Radeon RX 470 graphics card or better (min 3GB VRAM, DX12 support)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><